From: HiDeck maintainers
Subject: Use FindProtobuf's exported include directories for cross builds

The module-mode finder exports Protobuf_INCLUDE_DIRS. The uppercase plural
variable is not provided, leaving libadb unable to include protobuf headers.

--- a/vendor/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/vendor/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -117,2 +117,2 @@
-include_directories(${PROTOBUF_INCLUDE_DIRS})
+include_directories(${Protobuf_INCLUDE_DIRS})
 include_directories(${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR})
